OL,3,GNEWSAThree in court over county lines
OL,4,Adrug dealing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have appeared in court
OL,7,Faccused of being involved in county
OL,8,Flines drug dealing worth more than
OL,9,F#100,000.
OL,11,FThe trio were charged with possessing
OL,12,Fand supplying heroin and crack cocaine
OL,13,Fafter being arrested on Leeds Road in
OL,14,FBradford, on Tuesday.
OL,16,FPolice said drugs and cash were seized
OL,17,Fas part of an investigation into the
OL,18,Fdrugs line, which was operating within
OL,19,FBradford and traveling into North
OL,20,FYorkshire, South Yorkshire and the
OL,21,FHumber.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
